  "releaseNotes": "TSpec now mocks with its own engine instead of Moq\n\t\t\t* Moq is no longer a dependency: reference it directly if your tests use it\n\t\t\t* Write Any<T>() instead of Moq's It.IsAny and It.Is\n\t\t\t* Members obsolete in 2.8 are removed\n\t\t\t* Requires xUnit v3 4.x",
